From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:49:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] docs: document 32-bit futex_waitv and module-owned defaults

Update README.gki-docker.md for the new runtime policy: futex_waitv now
covers 32-bit tasks, default congestion control is cubic, ADIOS is opt-in,
zram defaults to lz4 with lz4kd switched by yudi-tweaks, and the runtime
toggles live in the KernelSU module rather than gki_defconfig.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
